.SH "نام (NAME)"
pmdasamba \- Samba performance metrics domain agent (PMDA)
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\fBpmdasamba\fR is a Performance Metrics Domain Agent (PMDA) which exports
metric values from Samba, a Windows SMB/CIFS server for UNIX.
.PP
In order for values to be made available by this PMDA, Samba must have
been built with profiling support (WITH_PROFILE in "smbd \-b" output).
This PMDA dynamically enumerates much of its metric hierarchy, based on
the contents of "smbstatus \-\-profile".
.PP
When the agent is installed (see below), the Install script will attempt
to enable Samba statistics gathering, using "smbcontrol \-\-profile".
.SH INSTALLATION
.IX Header "INSTALLATION"
If you want access to the names and values for the samba performance
metrics, do the following as root:
.PP
.Vb 2
\&        # cd $PCP_PMDAS_DIR/samba
\&        # ./Install
.Ve
.PP
If you want to undo the installation, do the following as root:
.PP
.Vb 2
\&        # cd $PCP_PMDAS_DIR/samba
\&        # ./Remove
.Ve
.PP
\&\fBpmdasamba\fR is launched by \fBpmcd\fR\|(1) and should never be executed
directly.  The Install and Remove scripts notify \fBpmcd\fR\|(1) when
the agent is installed or removed.
.SH "فایل‌ها (FILES)"
.IX Header "FILES"
.ie n .IP $PCP_PMDAS_DIR/samba/Install 4
.el .IP \f(CR$PCP_PMDAS_DIR\fR/samba/Install 4
.IX Item "$PCP_PMDAS_DIR/samba/Install"
installation script for the \fBpmdasamba\fR agent
.ie n .IP $PCP_PMDAS_DIR/samba/Remove 4
.el .IP \f(CR$PCP_PMDAS_DIR\fR/samba/Remove 4
.IX Item "$PCP_PMDAS_DIR/samba/Remove"
undo installation script for the \fBpmdasamba\fR agent
.ie n .IP $PCP_LOG_DIR/pmcd/samba.log 4
.el .IP \f(CR$PCP_LOG_DIR\fR/pmcd/samba.log 4
.IX Item "$PCP_LOG_DIR/pmcd/samba.log"
default log file for error messages from \fBpmdasamba\fR
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.IX Header "SEE ALSO"
\&\fBpmcd\fR\|(1), \fBsamba\fR\|(7) and \fBsmbd\fR\|(8).
